    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "One-shot staging QA, simulated payment. Negative CLOSE from SENT must return 409 without state change; positive CLOSE from PAID must return 200/CLOSED. Cleans up table afterward. Requires POS_STAGING with baseUrl and password. Not yet executed. Stop on failed assertions; 1 iteration. No secrets embedded."
